  The reel_script says the hostel is 'சமூகநீதி மாணவர் விடுதி' near the Namakkal Arignar Anna Government Arts College, but the article places the hostel on Mohanur Road, Lathuvadi area; the reel_script's 'near college' is consistent, but the caption's 'சமூகநீதி விடுதி' label is acceptable. No clear factual error found in reel_script beyond this.
  The reel_script states the collector 'உத்தரவிட்டார்' on Wednesday and the suspension is linked to failing to monitor drug use, which matches the article; however the slides_spec 'hl1' phrase 'நாமக்கல் விடுதியில் காப்பாளர் பணியிடை' is ungrammatical/incomplete as a headline line, lacking a clear meaning in Tamil.
